<title>USA: Dana affiliate to buy sealing products maker.</title>
<headline>Dana affiliate to buy sealing products maker.</headline>
<dateline>TOLEDO, Ohio 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dana Corp said on Tuesday that its Brazilian affiliate, Dana Industrias Ltda, has agreed to acquire the assets of Industrias Orlando Stevaux Ltda, a Brazilian manufacturer of gaskets and oil seals.</p>
<p>Terms of the transaction were not released.</p>
</text>
